sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as EventBridge Scheduler
    participant L as poc-schedule
    participant D as DynamoDB
    participant Q as SQS
    participant C as consumer

    S->>L: invoke (async) — Input is only {scheduleId}
    L->>D: GetItem
    L->>D: UpdateItem, conditional — claim to processing
    Note over L,D: a lost claim stops here:<br/>logged notClaimable, nothing published
    L->>Q: SendMessage
    L->>D: TransactWriteItems — current to executed<br/>AND next occurrence as pending
    L->>S: CreateSchedule for the next occurrence
    Q->>C: deliver
